The River City Library is pleased to announce the following new additions to
our collection:

- *The Harvester* by Gene Stratton-Porter — A lovely nature romance set in
  Indiana
- *Riders of the Purple Sage* by Zane Grey — For those who enjoy Western
  adventures
- *The Autobiography of an Ex-Colored Man* by James Weldon Johnson — A
  powerful anonymous work

As always, I encourage our patrons to expand their reading horizons. A
well-read mind is a well-prepared mind.

The new books will be available in the •defterm{stacks}—the shelving area
where books are stored, typically organized by call number—starting Monday.
